    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307181c65875d8907444be14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――作战名对吧！　『公主与王子殿下的心跳不已☆战胜高手作战』，\r\n『二人的牵绊！　召唤胜利的风暴作战』。我的提案是这两个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdaa9126d3da4512e7e0262fe49a8866cdc41b4b1ff72f70ff5f21b8884cf83e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1039/storytimeline_041039007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f05cd36eb2718ac131f76e94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，开过只有两人的作战会议之后――\r\n炎炎酷暑中，白热化的比赛开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "881388dfcbef26ac1d45804513038051185cea54a8b9acfddb77aa2cf90f79cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
