    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f6aec01e7d948443f3ba602",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哼，哎呀哎呀……！　你刚才自信满满的，\r\n现在就开始疲劳了吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad73d1c717e2c1411989e0271dc692e81d3059fa93b277c6446e08e01bb28ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
