    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370153bc59409323f8d0f48d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼、呼，呵呵呵……！　我先走一步咯！\r\n――欧啦啊啊啊啊啊啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5481bb29dd6a7775132c4d0f6cad3d29cf8a698bb3abddbaa7a574bc387e893d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1039/storytimeline_041039007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e21a87f403046da1804cfd97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是……举办集训的目的是要做训练，\r\n而这次还要举办一个活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4552afa22478660287eef7b0fcf70d4078e9d9153e98ab9e973a40c36b05ef2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
